  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Distributed Value near $15.82B (-1.9% 30D) keeps on-chain RWA exposure in a holding pattern\u2014tokenization momentum is still news- and pipeline-driven until distributed value breaks range. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/news-analysis/2026/08/26/sec-resurrecting-u-s-crypto-custody-rule-the-previous-administration-failed-to-land\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SEC resurrecting U.S. crypto custody rule the previous administration failed to land</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows.</li><li><strong>Institutional commitments are still a leading share signal:</strong> Bank and asset-manager distribution deals often shift platform and network leadership before headline RWA totals fully catch up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/markets/2026-08-26-altitude-sickness-can-wait-bitcoins-historic-short-squeeze-bessent-catalyst-may-signal-bull-market-reset-analysts-say-412785\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\u2018Altitude sickness can wait\u2019: Bitcoin\u2019s historic short squeeze, Bessent catalyst may signal bull-market reset, analysts say</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/defi/aave-opens-ios-early-access-keeps-android-and-web-waitlisted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Aave Opens iOS Early Access, Keeps Android and Web Waitlisted</a> (The Defiant).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
